update content_bodies set title = '真KAGAWA 統合版', description = '今回のうどん県プロモーション動画では、「真・KAGAWA – Authentic KAGAWA -」をテーマに、「深」「心」「新」「浸」のキーワードに沿った「真の香川＝本物の香川」を紹介しています。日本文化の一環として、書道を通じて日本人の心を震わせるコンテンツを取り入れ、書道パフォーマンスや書の鑑賞を通じて感動を共有します。書道家の郷祥氏が「真・KAGAWA」および「深」「心」「新」「浸」の文字を揮毫しました。' where id = '4UwOYUoTJoAAueJ1POq3B';
update content_bodies set title = 'True KAGAWA Integrated Edition', description = 'The promotional video for Kagawa Prefecture, themed ''True KAGAWA – Authentic KAGAWA,'' introduces the concept of ''True Kagawa = Real Kagawa'' through the keywords ''Depth,'' ''Heart,'' ''New,'' and ''Immerse.'' It incorporates elements of Japanese culture, particularly calligraphy, which resonates with the Japanese spirit through experiences like appreciating calligraphy and performance art. The calligraphy of the words ''True KAGAWA'' and the keywords was created by calligrapher Goshow.' where id = 'aTD6wGBMIOrucyUQLmq50';
